  partName: Sensor (4)
  description: The Sensor (4) is an elongated sensor positioned at the middle-center-rear
    of the engine, made of Material.001. It monitors critical engine parameters,
    providing vital data for optimal engine performance. One interesting aspect of
    this sensor is its ability to detect even slight changes in engine conditions,
    enabling prompt adjustments to prevent damage.
